# Unity writes its YAML/text assets with LF. Keep LF in the working tree too, so opening the project
# does not show every ProjectSettings file as modified on Windows (core.autocrlf).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.psd binary
*.fbx binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
